<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ site.name }} — Crafted To Captivate</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ site.name }} — {{ site.tagline }}. Fine jewellery, hand-finished in 18K gold, set with ethically sourced diamonds and rare gemstones."/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  :root{
    --cream:#f3eee6; --cream-2:#ece4d8; --sand:#e4d8c7;
    --ink:#3a342c; --ink-soft:#6b6253; --gold:#b8985f; --gold-deep:#9a7c45;
    --line:rgba(120,104,76,.22);
    --display:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; --ui:'Jost',sans-serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:300;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
  img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep);font-weight:400}
  .serif{font-family:var(--display)}
  .btn{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--ui);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;background:var(--gold-deep);padding:16px 34px;border:0;transition:.35s;cursor:pointer}
  .btn:hover{background:var(--ink)}
  .lnk{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold);padding-bottom:5px;transition:.3s;cursor:pointer;background:none;border-left:0;border-right:0;border-top:0}
  .lnk:hover{color:var(--gold-deep)}

  header.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;padding:16px 40px;transition:.4s;color:#fff}
  header.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(243,238,230,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
  header.nav.scrolled .brandmark .name,header.nav.scrolled nav.links a,header.nav.scrolled .nav-cta a,header.nav.scrolled .hamburger span{color:var(--ink)}
  header.nav.scrolled .hamburger span{background:var(--ink)}
  .brandmark{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;line-height:1;grid-column:2}
  .brandmark .star{color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .brandmark .name{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(20px,3.4vw,26px);letter-spacing:.22em;color:#fff;font-weight:500;transition:.4s}
  .brandmark .sub{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.5em;color:var(--gold);margin-top:3px}
  nav.links{display:flex;gap:30px;grid-column:1;justify-self:start}
  nav.links a{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;font-weight:400;transition:.3s;white-space:nowrap}
  nav.links a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
  .nav-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;grid-column:3;justify-self:end}
  .nav-cta a,.nav-cta button{color:#fff;transition:.4s;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--ui)}
  .nav-cta .book{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap}
  .hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;grid-column:1;justify-self:start;z-index:61;padding:4px}
  .hamburger span{width:24px;height:1.5px;background:#fff;transition:.35s;transform-origin:center}
  body.menu-open .hamburger span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6.5px) rotate(45deg);background:var(--ink)}
  body.menu-open .hamburger span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
  body.menu-open .hamburger span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6.5px) rotate(-45deg);background:var(--ink)}
  body.menu-open .brandmark .name{color:var(--ink)}
  body.menu-open .nav-cta a{color:var(--ink)}

  .drawer{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:55;background:var(--cream);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-12px);transition:.4s}
  body.menu-open .drawer{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
  .drawer a,.drawer button{font-family:var(--display);font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink);padding:12px 0;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}
  .drawer a.small,.drawer button.small{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep);margin-top:18px}
  .drawer .star{color:var(--gold);font-size:20px;margin-bottom:24px}

  .hero{position:relative;height:100vh;min-height:640px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
  .hero img.bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%}
  .hero .veil{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(40,34,26,.30),rgba(40,34,26,.12) 40%,rgba(40,34,26,.42))}
  .hero .inner{position:relative;z-index:2;color:#fff;padding-top:40px}
  .hero .star{color:#f0e2c4;font-size:18px}
  .hero h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:clamp(54px,9vw,116px);line-height:.96;margin:6px 0 2px;text-shadow:0 2px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
  .hero .h-sub{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:clamp(11px,1.4vw,14px);letter-spacing:.62em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f3e8d2;margin-bottom:30px}
  .hero .tag{font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:8px}
  .hero .tag2{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#efe4cf;margin-bottom:34px;line-height:2}
  .hero .btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
  .hero .btn:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .scrollcue{position:absolute;bottom:26px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:2;color:#fff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85;animation:bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translate(-50%,0)}50%{transform:translate(-50%,7px)}}

  .philo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:stretch}
  .philo .text{padding:clamp(48px,7vw,104px) clamp(32px,6vw,88px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
  .philo .text .eyebrow{margin-bottom:26px}
  .philo h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:.01em}
  .philo h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  .philo p{margin:26px 0 34px;max-width:430px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.95;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .philo .img{min-height:440px}
  .philo .img img{object-position:center}

  .collections{padding:clamp(60px,7vw,100px) 0 0}
  .sec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin:0 0 38px}
  .sec-head .eyebrow{white-space:nowrap}
  .sec-head .rule{height:1px;background:var(--line);flex:1}
  .col-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
  .col-card{position:relative;aspect-ratio:3/4;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;display:block}
  .col-card img{transition:transform 1.1s ease}
  .col-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .col-card .ov{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.05),rgba(0,0,0,.34));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#fff}
  .col-card .ov h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);letter-spacing:.2em}
  .col-card .ov span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:8px;color:#f0e6d4}

  .precision{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;background:var(--cream-2)}
  .precision .img{aspect-ratio:16/11}
  .precision .body{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,90px) clamp(32px,6vw,80px)}
  .precision h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,54px);line-height:1.06}
  .precision .cap{margin-top:22px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep);line-height:2.4}

  .craft{padding:clamp(58px,7vw,96px) 0}
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;align-items:start;margin-top:34px}
  .step{text-align:center;position:relative}
  .step .ic{width:42px;height:42px;margin:0 auto 16px;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  .step .ic svg{width:100%;height:100%}
  .step h4{font-family:var(--ui);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:8px}
  .step p{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.7;max-width:150px;margin:0 auto}
  .step:not(:last-child):after{content:"→";position:absolute;top:14px;right:-6px;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px}

  .life{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:0}
  .life .cell{aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden}
  .life .cell img{transition:transform 1s ease}
  .life .cell:hover img{transform:scale(1.05)}

  .exp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr}
  .exp .imgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .exp .imgs .cell{aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden}
  .exp .body{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,88px) clamp(32px,5vw,72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;background:var(--cream)}
  .exp h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1.12}
  .exp .lnk{margin-top:30px;align-self:flex-start}

  .quotes{padding:clamp(56px,7vw,96px) 0;background:var(--cream-2)}
  .q-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:48px;margin-top:40px}
  .q{position:relative;padding-left:22px}
  .q .mark{font-family:var(--display);font-size:46px;color:var(--gold);line-height:.6;position:absolute;left:-4px;top:8px}
  .q p{font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink)}
  .q .who{margin-top:18px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep)}

  footer{background:var(--cream);padding:64px 0 30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center}
  footer .brandmark{margin-bottom:30px}
  footer nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:30px;margin-bottom:34px}
  footer nav a,footer nav button{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--ui)}
  footer .base{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}
  footer .base a{color:inherit}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .9s ease,transform .9s ease}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  @media(max-width:1080px){header.nav{padding:16px 28px}nav.links{gap:22px}.nav-cta{gap:16px}.steps{gap:8px}.step p{font-size:11px}}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    header.nav{padding:14px 20px;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr}
    nav.links{display:none}.nav-cta .book{display:none}.hamburger{display:flex}
    .philo,.precision,.exp{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .philo .text{order:2;padding:clamp(40px,8vw,64px) 24px}
    .philo .img{order:1;min-height:0;aspect-ratio:4/3}
    .precision .img{aspect-ratio:16/10}.precision .body{padding:48px 24px}
    .col-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.col-card{aspect-ratio:4/5}
    .col-grid .col-card:nth-child(3){grid-column:1/-1;aspect-ratio:16/9}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:34px 12px}
    .step:not(:last-child):after{display:none}.step:nth-child(4),.step:nth-child(5){grid-column:span 1}
    .life{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .life .cell:nth-child(4),.life .cell:nth-child(5){display:none}
    .exp .imgs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.exp .body{padding:48px 24px}
    .q-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;max-width:480px;margin-inline:auto}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .wrap{padding:0 18px}
    .hero{min-height:540px;height:92vh}.hero .inner{padding-top:30px}
    .hero .h-sub{margin-bottom:22px}.hero .tag2{margin-bottom:26px}
    .sec-head{margin-bottom:26px}
    .col-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.col-card{aspect-ratio:3/4}
    .col-grid .col-card:nth-child(3){grid-column:auto;aspect-ratio:3/4}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px 14px;text-align:center}
    .step:nth-child(5){grid-column:1/-1}.step p{max-width:none}
    .life{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.life .cell:nth-child(5){display:none}
    .exp .imgs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    footer{padding:48px 0 26px}footer nav{gap:18px 22px}footer .base{flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  }
  @media(max-width:380px){
    header.nav{padding:12px 16px}.brandmark .name{font-size:19px}.hero h1{font-size:46px}
    .life{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.exp .imgs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.btn{padding:14px 26px;font-size:10px}
  }
  @media(max-height:520px) and (orientation:landscape){.hero{height:auto;min-height:0;padding:120px 0 70px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}}

  .material-symbols-outlined{font-variation-settings:'FILL' 0,'wght' 300,'GRAD' 0,'opsz' 24}
</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-surface">

{% set studs_slug = collections[0].slug if collections and collections[0] else 'studs' %}
{% set drops_slug = collections[1].slug if collections and collections[1] else 'drops' %}
{% set floral_slug = collections[2].slug if collections and collections[2] else 'floral' %}

<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <button class="hamburger" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  <nav class="links">
    <a href="/collections">Collections</a>
    <a href="#craft">Craftsmanship</a>
    <a href="/portfolio">Fine Jewellery</a>
    <a href="/about">Our Story</a>
  </nav>
  <a href="/" class="brandmark" aria-label="{{ site.name }} home">
    <span class="star">✦</span>
    <span class="name">{{ site.name }}</span>
    <span class="sub">DIAMONDS</span>
  </a>
  <div class="nav-cta">
    <button type="button" data-enquire data-title="Book a Private Consultation" class="book">Book Consultation</button>
    <button type="button" data-enquire data-title="Enquire" aria-label="Enquiries">⊕</button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="drawer" id="drawer">
  <span class="star">✦</span>
  <a href="/collections">Collections</a>
  <a href="#craft">Craftsmanship</a>
  <a href="/portfolio">Fine Jewellery</a>
  <a href="/about">Our Story</a>
  <button type="button" data-enquire data-title="Book a Private Consultation" class="small">Book Consultation</button>
</div>

<section class="hero">
  <img class="bg" src="/images/home/home-01-9cdc7f1d.jpg" alt="Model wearing {{ site.name }} diamond drop earrings">
  <div class="veil"></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="star">✦</div>
    <h1 class="serif">{{ site.name }}</h1>
    <div class="h-sub">Diamonds</div>
    <div class="tag serif">Crafted To Captivate.</div>
    <div class="tag2">Not Just A Jewel.<br>A Feeling.</div>
    <a href="/collections" class="btn">Discover The Collection</a>
  </div>
  <div class="scrollcue">Scroll</div>
</section>

<section class="philo" id="story">
  <div class="text reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">The {{ site.name }} Philosophy</div>
    <h2 class="serif">We do not<br>create jewelry.<br><em>We create moments<br>that become heirlooms.</em></h2>
    <p>At {{ site.name }} Diamonds, every piece is a reflection of timeless beauty, crafted with precision, passion, and a promise to be cherished forever.</p>
    <a href="/about" class="lnk">Discover Our Story</a>
  </div>
  <div class="img reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-02-2040dddb.jpg" alt="Model wearing a delicate {{ site.name }} diamond necklace"></div>
</section>

<section class="collections wrap" id="collections">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Signature Collections</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
  <div class="col-grid">
    <a class="col-card reveal" href="/collections/{{ studs_slug }}"><img src="/images/home/home-03-94294779.jpg" alt="Radiance Collection"><div class="ov"><h3 class="serif">RADIANCE</h3><span>Collection</span></div></a>
    <a class="col-card reveal" href="/collections/{{ drops_slug }}"><img src="/images/home/home-04-7caeec2d.jpg" alt="Eternity Collection"><div class="ov"><h3 class="serif">ETERNITY</h3><span>Collection</span></div></a>
    <a class="col-card reveal" href="/collections/{{ floral_slug }}"><img src="/images/home/home-05-fe888040.jpg" alt="Lumière Collection"><div class="ov"><h3 class="serif">LUMIÈRE</h3><span>Collection</span></div></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="precision">
  <div class="img"><img src="/images/home/home-06-363fd6ff.jpg" alt="{{ site.name }} kite-cut green sapphire ring"></div>
  <div class="body reveal">
    <h2 class="serif">Precision In<br>Every Facet.</h2>
    <div class="cap">Exceptional Diamonds.<br>Extraordinary You.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="craft wrap" id="craft">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">The {{ site.name }} Craftsmanship</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M20 6 33 16 20 34 7 16Z"/><path d="M7 16h26M20 6v28M13 16l7 18 7-18"/></svg></div><h4>Selection</h4><p>Handpicked for brilliance &amp; purity</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="13"/><path d="M20 7v26M7 20h26M11 11l18 18M29 11 11 29"/></svg></div><h4>Cutting</h4><p>Precision cut to perfect every facet</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M20 9l5 6-5 16-5-16Z"/><circle cx="20" cy="15" r="9"/></svg></div><h4>Setting</h4><p>Expertly set for enduring beauty</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="12"/><path d="M15 20a5 5 0 0 1 5-5"/></svg></div><h4>Polishing</h4><p>Finished to achieve timeless radiance</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M20 5v30M5 20h30M9 9l22 22M31 9 9 31"/></svg></div><h4>Forever</h4><p>Created to be cherished for generations</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="life">
  <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-07-8971946d.jpg" alt="Layered diamond necklace on model"></div>
  <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-03-94294779.jpg" alt="Pink pear leaf ring"></div>
  <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-01-9cdc7f1d.jpg" alt="Diamond drop earrings on model"></div>
  <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-08-743e1ea0.jpg" alt="Gold cluster bracelet"></div>
  <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-09-cddb60b8.jpg" alt="Pink heart stud earrings"></div>
</section>

<section class="exp" id="experience">
  <div class="imgs">
    <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-10-c698d09b.jpg" alt="Silver star bracelet in a {{ site.name }} box"></div>
    <div class="cell reveal"><img src="/images/home/home-11-32a95b74.jpg" alt="Gemstone bracelet beautifully presented"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="body reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:22px">The {{ site.name }} Experience</div>
    <h2 class="serif">Every {{ site.name }} piece arrives as beautifully as it will be remembered.</h2>
    <button type="button" data-enquire data-title="Book a Private Atelier Experience" class="lnk">Discover The Experience</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quotes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" style="justify-content:center"><span class="eyebrow">Stories That Shine</span></div>
    <div class="q-grid">
      <div class="q reveal"><span class="mark serif">&ldquo;</span><p>He proposed with a {{ site.name }} ring. The moment felt suspended in light.</p><div class="who">— Ananya S.</div></div>
      <div class="q reveal"><span class="mark serif">&ldquo;</span><p>It&rsquo;s not just the sparkle, it&rsquo;s the feeling it holds.</p><div class="who">— Meghna R.</div></div>
      <div class="q reveal"><span class="mark serif">&ldquo;</span><p>Timeless elegance, crafted with so much love.</p><div class="who">— Priyanka D.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
